# Repository hygiene for a static, build-free site.
#
# Scope note: this file deliberately does NOT ignore node_modules/, dist/, or
# build output. There is no build step, no package manifest, and none of those
# directories exist. Add them in the same change that introduces the tooling,
# so this file never implies a project shape that isn't real.

# Local agent configuration. Until now this was kept out of the repository only
# by a machine-local global gitignore, which is not portable to other clones.
.claude/

# Environment and secrets. Never commit these.
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Logs
*.log

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor and tooling temporaries
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
